  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian Red Cross - DFAT Humanitarian Partnership global humanitarian programs 2025 -2033</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Red Cross - DFAT Humanitarian Partnership Program supports up to twelve Red Cross Red Crescent national societies in the Pacific (Fiji, Tonga, PNG, Solomon Islands, Kiribati, Tuvalu and Vanautu) and Asia (Bangladesh, Timor-Leste, Indonesia, Myanmar and Mongolia) to prepare for, respond to and recover from disasters. The program takes a locally-led approach and provides core cost support, technical assistance to enable organisational strengthening and improved disaster response capabilities and support for their role as auxiliary to government.</narrative>
  </description>
